<title>UK: TABLE-Daily Mail H1 pretax rises 27 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Daily Mail H1 pretax rises 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		27.8		vs 22.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.0		 vs 4.6</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	46.9		vs 36.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   545.0	     vs 476.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British newspaper group is Daily Mail &amp; General Trust Plc.</p>
